ts,param,value
# Copy this file to ground_truth.csv and fill in your human visual
# estimate per frame×parameter. ts is the folder name under
# phone_measurements/<ts>/, param is "pH" / "H2O2" / "PHMB",
# value is the number your eye reads off the strip.
# Example rows:
# 1780073195000,pH,7.8
# 1780073195000,H2O2,55
# 1780073199000,pH,7.6
